---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Why Choose Crest Automotive Care in DLF Gurugram" description="Learn why Crest Automotive Care is a considered choice for premium in-house car detailing and protection in DLF Gurugram." currentPath="/why-crest" pageNumber="04" pageLabel="The Crest difference">
  <section class="why-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">Why Crest</span><h1>Luxury care with a lighter <em>footprint.</em></h1><p>We bring 65+ years of combined automotive OEM experience to an in-house service built for DLF residents. No workshop drop-offs. No rushed handovers. Just a better way to care for the car you already love.</p><a class="button button-gold" href="/contact">Talk to the team <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="why-image" style="background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(19,19,21,.10), rgba(19,19,21,.78)), url('/images/drive/headlight-restoration.jpeg');"><span>PRECISION PROCESS</span><small>Protected finish · trained hands</small></div></section>
  <section class="reason-section"><div class="reason-intro"><span class="eyebrow">The Crest standard</span><h2>Careful by<br /><em>design.</em></h2><p>Every part of the process has a reason, from the waterless emulsion to the final handover.</p></div><div class="reason-grid"><article><h3>Waterless by design</h3><p>Our emulsion uses avocado and organo-modified oils to surround dust particles, reduce surface tension and create a microscopic wax layer between dirt and paint.</p></article><article><h3>Made for premium cars</h3><p>Trained staff, careful workflows and the right treatment for every vehicle category, from hatchbacks and sedans through super-luxury cars.</p></article><article><h3>Before you drive out</h3><p>Daily service from 5 AM to 6 PM inside DLF The Camellias, DLF Crest and DLF The Magnolias so the car stays close while it is being cared for.</p></article><article><h3>One roof, more support</h3><p>Alongside detailing, Crest connects customers with Rodim PPF, coatings, insurance assistance, breakdown support, repair tie-ups and pre-owned car support.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="stats-section"><div><strong>3,15,000+</strong><span>cars cared for</span></div><div><strong>30M+</strong><span>litres of water saved</span></div><div><strong>5 AM–6 PM</strong><span>daily service window</span></div><div><strong>2021</strong><span>Startup India / MSME</span></div></section>
  <section class="why-cta"><div><span class="eyebrow">Ready when you are</span><h2>Let’s care for<br /><em>your car next.</em></h2></div><a class="button button-gold" href="/contact">Book a treatment <span>↗</span></a></section>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  .why-hero, .reason-section, .stats-section, .why-cta { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 110px 24px; }
  .why-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .9fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; min-height: 600px; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--gold); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1, h2, h3 { color: var(--white); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  h1 { max-width: 700px; margin: 18px 0 24px; font-size: clamp(51px,6vw,82px); }
  h2 { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: clamp(43px,5vw,65px); }
  .why-hero p { max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 32px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; }
  .why-image { min-height: 470px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: end; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background-size: cover; background-position: center; }
  .why-image span, .why-image small { color: var(--white); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .why-image small { margin-top: 7px; color: #c3cedd; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .02em; }
  .reason-section { max-width: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; gap: 85px; background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(14,14,16,.95), rgba(27,27,29,.8)), url('/images/drive/headlight-restoration.jpeg'); background-position:center; background-size:cover; }
  .reason-intro, .reason-grid { max-width: var(--max); }
  .reason-intro { justify-self: end; max-width: 290px; }
  .reason-intro p { margin-top: 25px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .reason-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); gap: 13px; }
  .reason-grid article { min-height: 240px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(255,255,255,.025); transition: transform .3s var(--ease), border-color .25s ease; }
  .reason-grid article:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); border-color: rgba(59,130,246,.72); }
  .reason-grid article > span { color: var(--gold); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
  .reason-grid h3 { margin: 38px 0 11px; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .reason-grid p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .stats-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); max-width: none; padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .why-cta { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .why-cta h2 { margin: 12px 0 0; color: var(--white); font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 62px); }
  .why-cta .button { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .stats-section div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding: 28px 24px; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .stats-section strong { color: var(--white); font-size: 18px; }
  .stats-section span { color: #8998ad; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  @media (max-width: 880px) { .why-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 45px; } .reason-section { display: block; } .reason-intro { max-width: var(--max); margin-bottom: 45px; } }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .why-hero, .reason-section, .why-cta { padding: 80px 20px; } .why-hero { min-height: auto; padding-top: 88px; } .why-image { min-height: 340px; } .reason-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .stats-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } .stats-section div { padding: 18px 20px; } .why-cta { display: block; } .why-cta .button { display: inline-flex; margin-top: 28px; width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; } }
</style>
